<Prose>
  <h2>Why pages are JSON</h2>
  <p>A page is a list of sections and their content. That is what makes it editable by a CMS, generable by an agent and diffable in git.</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Same schema for JSON and Markdown pages.</li>
    <li>Rendered through one pipeline.</li>
  </ul>
  <blockquote>The contract is the schema, not our code.</blockquote>
</Prose>
